  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Security Program in Western and Central Africa, Nigeria - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building from World Bank and partner efforts, the proposed Program provides a platform to strengthen critical core capacities for prevention, preparedness, and response to health emergencies. The Program will invest in key interconnected systems for improving health security designed with a One Health approach, capitalizing on multisectoral collaboration, and convening partner investments.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase regional collaboration and health system capacities to prevent, detect, and respond to health emergencies in the Federal Republic of Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
